# Shared VHS settings for every serra tape.
#
# Sourced as the first line of each tape. It carries no Output command, so
# it is never recorded on its own. Tapes that need a taller or shorter
# terminal override Set Height right after sourcing this.

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set Framerate 24
